{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"ja","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-21024","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21024-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21024-0","text":"巡狩の運命専用の光円錐、光円錐のスキルはこの運命にのみ有効。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21024-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21024-1","text":"剣を修練する少年は休憩を取る。\n日の光が彼の首元を暖め、彼はゆっくりと水に入る、\n足が入った時、冷たさを感じる、\nでも鈴は鳴り、鳥も啼く、\n遠方の人々は知る、春が来ると。","speaker":""}]}
